# Documentation

Whenever you add a new feature or plugin, update **user-facing** documentation in `/docs` (English). Monorepo-internal notes (packages, release, site build) belong in `/contributing`, which is not published on docs.stream-kit.app. Regenerate API reference pages with `pnpm generate:docs-reference` when adding or changing triggers/handlers.

For plugin, overlay, and app-core code changes, also follow `.cursor/rules/docs-site-sync.mdc`.
